WEBVTT

00:07.724 --> 00:09.000
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.068 --> 00:10.689
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.758 --> 00:12.172
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.241 --> 00:14.137
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.206 --> 00:17.206
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:17.275 --> 00:19.275
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.344 --> 00:21.275
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.344 --> 00:23.172
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.241 --> 00:24.862
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:24.931 --> 00:27.310
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.379 --> 00:29.310
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.379 --> 00:31.241
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.310 --> 00:33.275
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.344 --> 00:35.137
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.206 --> 00:37.275
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.344 --> 00:39.413
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.482 --> 00:40.724
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.793 --> 00:42.586
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.655 --> 00:45.344
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.413 --> 00:47.620
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:47.689 --> 00:49.275
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:51.689 --> 00:54.620
[ominous music]
[不祥的音乐]

00:54.689 --> 01:00.034
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:00.103 --> 01:01.137
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

01:01.206 --> 01:04.931
[laughter]
[笑声]

01:05.000 --> 01:07.448
[inhaling]
[吸气]

01:07.517 --> 01:09.862
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:09.931 --> 01:12.655
[cranking]
[启动]

01:12.724 --> 01:14.103
[spitting]
[随地吐痰]

01:14.172 --> 01:17.310
[gurgling]
[淙淙]

01:17.379 --> 01:18.103
- [laughs]
- [笑]

01:18.172 --> 01:21.862
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

01:21.931 --> 01:24.068
- Hey, Sandy.
- 嘿，桑迪。

01:24.137 --> 01:27.586
- Hey, SpongeBob.
- Check out our new balloon.
- 嘿，海绵宝宝。
- 看看我们的新气球。

01:27.655 --> 01:29.482
- Her name is Squeaky.
- 她的名字叫吱吱。

01:29.551 --> 01:32.344
[squeaking]
[吱吱声]

01:32.413 --> 01:34.586
- Sorry, guys, I'm working on
my new invention.
- 对不起，伙计们，我正在努力
我的新发明。

01:34.655 --> 01:36.413
Y'all better
come back tomorrow.
你们都好点了
明天回来。

01:36.482 --> 01:37.862
[exclaiming]
[惊呼]

01:37.931 --> 01:40.379
both: New invention!
两者：新发明！

01:40.448 --> 01:41.379
- See?
- 看？

01:41.448 --> 01:42.827
[whirring]
[呼呼]

01:42.896 --> 01:44.689
both: Ooh.
两人：哦。

01:44.758 --> 01:46.344
- What is it?
- 这是什么？

01:46.413 --> 01:49.310
- It's a portal
to other worlds.
- 这是一个门户
到其他世界。

01:49.379 --> 01:51.620
I built it to explore
the universe.
我建造它是为了探索
宇宙。

01:51.689 --> 01:53.620
Also for quick trips
to Texas to pick up
也适合快速旅行
前往德克萨斯州接载

01:53.689 --> 01:56.724
some of my favorite
barbecued nuts.
一些我最喜欢的
烤坚果。

01:56.793 --> 01:57.758
Yoink!
哟哟！

01:57.827 --> 01:59.689
- Huh?
Dagnabbit!
- 啊？
该死！

01:59.758 --> 02:04.689
That ding-dang,
nut-stealing arm is back again!
那个叮当，
偷坚果的手臂又回来了！

02:04.758 --> 02:06.379
[munching]
[咀嚼]

02:06.448 --> 02:07.931
- Pretty nifty, huh?
- 很漂亮，是吧？

02:08.000 --> 02:09.724
- Yeah.
- 是的。

02:09.793 --> 02:11.827
Nifty.
漂亮。

02:11.896 --> 02:13.344
Ooh, what's this do?
哦哦，这是做什么的？

02:13.413 --> 02:16.482
Vroom, vroom, vroom!
[screeches]
呜呜呜呜！
[尖叫声]

02:16.551 --> 02:17.896
[exclaiming]
[惊呼]

02:17.965 --> 02:19.655
- [beeping]
- [嘟嘟声]

02:19.724 --> 02:21.206
[exclaiming]
[惊呼]

02:21.275 --> 02:23.103
[laughter]
[笑声]

02:23.172 --> 02:25.931
- Hold it,
don't touch anything.
- 握住它，
不要碰任何东西。

02:26.000 --> 02:29.827
I gotta go grab some 1/16 inch
diodes to finish this weld.
我得去拿一些 1/16 英寸的
二极管来完成这个焊接。

02:29.896 --> 02:31.379
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

02:31.448 --> 02:33.172
- Patrick, you heard Sandy.
- 帕特里克，你听到桑迪的话了。

02:33.241 --> 02:35.896
We shouldn't touch this,
or this, or this,
我们不应该碰这个，
或者这个，或者这个，

02:35.965 --> 02:37.931
or this, or this, or this.
或者这个，或者这个，或者这个。

02:38.000 --> 02:39.655
[beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

02:39.724 --> 02:43.310
[laughing]
[笑]

02:43.379 --> 02:46.103
- Definitely don't do this,
SpongeBob.
- 绝对不要这样做
海绵宝宝。

02:46.172 --> 02:47.896
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

02:47.965 --> 02:51.103
Or this.
[exclaiming]
或者这个。
[惊呼]

02:51.172 --> 02:55.896
- And under no circumstances
should you ever touch this.
- 并且在任何情况下
你应该碰一下这个吗？

02:55.965 --> 02:57.034
Boink.
操。

02:57.103 --> 02:59.620
[alarm blaring]
[警报声]

02:59.689 --> 03:03.310
[whirring]
[呼呼]

03:03.379 --> 03:05.068
both: Whoa.
两人：哇哦。

03:05.137 --> 03:08.724
[stammering]
[结巴]

03:08.793 --> 03:10.482
- [gasps]
Oh, no!
- [喘气]
哦，不！

03:10.551 --> 03:12.655
You've activated the vortex!
你已经激活了漩涡！

03:12.724 --> 03:15.034
- Ooh, so swirly.
- 哦，太旋涡了。

03:15.103 --> 03:16.827
- Look at all the colors.
- 看看所有的颜色。

03:16.896 --> 03:18.206
[exclaiming]
[惊呼]

03:18.275 --> 03:20.103
- Whatever you do,
don't walk into it!
- 无论你做什么，
不要走进它！

03:20.172 --> 03:22.551
- Can we skip into it?
- 我们可以跳进去吗？

03:22.620 --> 03:24.517
[exclaiming]
[惊呼]

03:24.586 --> 03:26.310
- SpongeBob SquarePants,
Patrick Star,
- 海绵宝宝，
帕特里克·斯塔,

03:26.379 --> 03:28.000
you stop right now!
你现在就停下来！

03:28.068 --> 03:30.448
Now turn around.
现在转身。

03:30.517 --> 03:33.655
Now walk.
现在步行。

03:33.724 --> 03:36.586
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:36.655 --> 03:37.620
[gasps]
[喘气]

03:37.689 --> 03:39.551
Oh!
[groans]
哦！
[呻吟]

03:39.620 --> 03:43.620
Those two ain't no smarter
than a circus peanut.
这两个人并不聪明
比马戏团的花生。

03:43.689 --> 03:47.586
[screaming]
[尖叫]

03:47.655 --> 03:50.206
[exclaiming]
[惊呼]

03:50.275 --> 03:52.551
[horse whinnies]
[马嘶声]

03:53.896 --> 03:55.931
- Wow!
- Whoa!
- 哇！
- 哇！

03:56.000 --> 03:57.206
- Oh, oh!
- 哦，哦！

03:57.275 --> 03:59.517
[exclaiming]
[惊呼]

03:59.586 --> 04:00.827
- Goodness.
- 天哪。

04:00.896 --> 04:03.034
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

04:03.103 --> 04:05.172
Mm, mm.
嗯，嗯。

04:05.241 --> 04:06.620
- Wow.
- 哇。

04:06.689 --> 04:11.034
We've entered
a whole new dimension.
我们已经进入了
一个全新的维度。

04:11.103 --> 04:13.655
Uh, a blank, white, empty one.
呃，一张空白的、白色的、空的。

04:13.724 --> 04:16.655
- Must be the boring dimension.
- 必须是无聊的尺寸。

04:16.724 --> 04:17.724
Let's go home.
我们回家吧。

04:17.793 --> 04:19.586
- Maybe there's
an exit this way.
-也许有
出口是这样的。

04:20.896 --> 04:23.689
Huh, hmm, must've made
a wrong turn.
呵呵，一定是做出来了
转错了方向。

04:25.034 --> 04:26.827
Huh?
啊？

04:26.896 --> 04:30.758
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

04:32.931 --> 04:35.655
Patrick, there's no escape!
There's no escape, Patrick!
帕特里克，无路可逃！
无处可逃，帕特里克！

04:35.724 --> 04:38.137
- [sobbing]
I can't take it!
- [抽泣]
我受不了！

04:38.206 --> 04:39.827
Let me out of here!
让我离开这里！

04:39.896 --> 04:43.793
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

04:43.862 --> 04:47.758
[exclaiming]
[惊呼]

04:47.827 --> 04:49.517
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

04:49.586 --> 04:52.413
- [panting]
- [screeches]
- [气喘吁吁]
- [尖叫声]

04:52.482 --> 04:56.206
- Hmm.
- Huh?
- 唔。
- 啊？

04:56.275 --> 04:58.448
both: Ooh!
两人：哦！

04:58.517 --> 04:59.620
[grunts]
[咕哝]

04:59.689 --> 05:00.655
Mm...
毫米...

05:00.724 --> 05:03.482
[laughs]
Oh, Patrick, watch this!
[笑]
哦，帕特里克，看这个！

05:03.551 --> 05:06.068
[grunts]
Boink.
[咕哝]
操。

05:06.137 --> 05:07.724
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

05:07.793 --> 05:08.724
- [laughs]
- [笑]

05:08.793 --> 05:09.620
[motor revs]
[电机转速]

05:09.689 --> 05:11.896
[grunts]
- Whoops, sorry!
[咕哝]
- 哎呀，抱歉！

05:13.379 --> 05:15.448
- Heh, draw some more!
- 呵呵，再画一些吧！

05:15.517 --> 05:18.896
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:18.965 --> 05:20.620
- Nice décor.
- 漂亮的装饰。

05:20.689 --> 05:21.620
Hmm.
唔。

05:21.689 --> 05:25.413
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

05:25.482 --> 05:28.413
[light music]
[轻音乐]

05:28.482 --> 05:31.241
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:31.310 --> 05:35.206
- Oh, my house!
- 哦，我的房子！

05:35.275 --> 05:38.517
Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, ah!
Hey!
啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！
嘿！

05:38.586 --> 05:41.310
- Oops, forgot to draw
the ground.
- 哎呀，忘记画了
地面。

05:41.379 --> 05:43.586
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:43.655 --> 05:45.586
[thud]
- [grunts]
[砰]
- [咕哝]

05:45.655 --> 05:47.103
[groans]
[呻吟]

05:47.172 --> 05:48.103
[rumbling]
[隆隆声]

05:48.172 --> 05:49.103
Ahh.
啊。

05:49.172 --> 05:50.344
I'm starving.
我饿死了。

05:50.413 --> 05:51.482
- No problem.
- 没问题。

05:51.551 --> 05:53.827
Two patties coming right up!
两块肉饼马上就上来了！

05:53.896 --> 05:55.724
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

05:55.793 --> 05:57.275
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:57.344 --> 05:59.000
- Your doodle patty, sir.
- 你的涂鸦馅饼，先生。

05:59.068 --> 06:00.413
- [chomps]
- [咀嚼]

06:00.482 --> 06:03.793
- [chomps]
- [grunts]
- [咀嚼]
- [咕哝]

06:03.862 --> 06:05.068
Tastes weird.
味道怪怪的。

06:05.137 --> 06:06.758
- Yeah, they are a little dry.
- 是的，它们有点干。

06:06.827 --> 06:08.034
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

06:08.103 --> 06:10.137
- I miss real Krabby Patties.
- 我想念真正的蟹黄饼。

06:10.206 --> 06:12.034
- I miss Mr. Krabs.
- 我想念蟹老板。

06:12.103 --> 06:13.448
- I miss Sandy.
- 我想念桑迪。

06:13.517 --> 06:15.551
- I miss Gary.
- 我想念加里。

06:15.620 --> 06:18.344
both: I miss Squidward.
两人：我想念章鱼哥。

06:18.413 --> 06:22.000
- You know who
I miss most of all?
- 你知道是谁
我最想念的是？

06:22.068 --> 06:23.758
SpongeBob.
海绵宝宝。

06:23.827 --> 06:25.482
- But Patrick, I'm right here.
- 但是帕特里克，我就在这里。

06:25.551 --> 06:28.379
- [babbling]
- [胡言乱语]

06:28.448 --> 06:29.862
- Aww, isn't he cute?
- 哇哦，他不是很可爱吗？

06:29.931 --> 06:31.413
- How do you do?
- 你好吗？

06:31.482 --> 06:33.137
- [babbles]
- [胡言乱语]

06:33.206 --> 06:35.448
- Ooh, I'm next
on the hug list.
-哦，下一个是我
在拥抱名单上。

06:35.517 --> 06:38.448
- Oh, oh!
He disappeared!
- 哦，哦！
他消失了！

06:38.517 --> 06:40.862
Oh, why was I cursed
with the hug of death?
哦，为什么我被诅咒了
与死亡的拥抱？

06:40.931 --> 06:43.068
Why?
- He's not gone, Patrick.
为什么？
- 他没有走，帕特里克。

06:43.137 --> 06:44.758
He's right there
on your tum-tum.
他就在那里
在你的转轮上。

06:44.827 --> 06:45.551
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

06:45.620 --> 06:47.068
all: [babbling]
全体：[胡言乱语]

06:47.137 --> 06:48.344
[exclaiming]
[惊呼]

06:48.413 --> 06:49.931
- [giggling]
- [咯咯笑]

06:50.000 --> 06:51.000
[chomping]
Oh!
[咀嚼]
哦！

06:51.068 --> 06:52.896
all: [exclaiming]
全体：[惊呼]

06:52.965 --> 06:55.206
- Get 'em off!
Get 'em off me, SpongeBob!
- 把他们放开！
把他们从我身上拿开，海绵宝宝！

06:55.275 --> 06:56.206
[chomping]
[咀嚼]

06:56.275 --> 06:57.586
[exclaiming]
[惊呼]

06:57.655 --> 07:00.206
- Hold on, Patrick!
- 坚持住，帕特里克！

07:00.275 --> 07:01.827
[splashing]
[溅]

07:01.896 --> 07:03.275
[screams]
[尖叫声]

07:03.344 --> 07:05.827
- Oh, thanks, buddy.
-哦，谢谢，伙计。

07:05.896 --> 07:07.551
- You're welcome.
- 不客气。

07:07.620 --> 07:09.758
I guess we need to be
more careful.
我想我们需要
更加小心。

07:09.827 --> 07:12.379
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

07:12.448 --> 07:18.448
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:18.517 --> 07:21.172
[screaming]
[尖叫]

07:21.241 --> 07:22.551
- [babbles]
- Nice DoodleBob.
- [胡言乱语]
- 漂亮的涂鸦鲍勃。

07:22.620 --> 07:24.275
Put the pencil down.
把铅笔放下。

07:24.344 --> 07:26.896
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

07:26.965 --> 07:27.896
[clang]
[铛]

07:27.965 --> 07:28.896
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

07:28.965 --> 07:30.275
- Oh, run!
- 哦，快跑！

07:30.344 --> 07:34.241
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

07:34.310 --> 07:36.000
[exclaiming]
[惊呼]

07:36.068 --> 07:38.068
[clanging]
[叮叮当当]

07:38.137 --> 07:40.517
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

07:40.586 --> 07:42.172
What are we gonna do,
SpongeBob?
我们要做什么，
海绵宝宝？

07:42.241 --> 07:43.931
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

07:44.000 --> 07:45.172
[whirring]
[呼呼]

07:45.241 --> 07:48.206
We'll have to fight doodle
with doodle.
我们必须与涂鸦作斗争
与涂鸦。

07:48.275 --> 07:50.379
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

07:50.448 --> 07:51.724
Hold it right there.
把它握在那里。

07:51.793 --> 07:54.862
You're no match
for my doodle squad!
你不是对手
为了我的涂鸦小队！

07:54.931 --> 07:56.137
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

07:56.206 --> 07:57.517
Attack!
攻击！

07:57.586 --> 07:59.000
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

07:59.068 --> 08:00.413
- [babbling]
- [胡言乱语]

08:00.482 --> 08:02.034
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:02.103 --> 08:05.344
[babbling]
[胡说]

08:05.413 --> 08:08.551
[grumbling]
[抱怨]

08:08.620 --> 08:10.068
- Patrick, run!
- 帕特里克，快跑！

08:10.137 --> 08:11.206
- Ooh!
- 哦！

08:11.275 --> 08:14.241
- [babbling]
- [胡言乱语]

08:14.310 --> 08:18.068
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

08:18.137 --> 08:20.310
[babbling]
[胡说]

08:20.379 --> 08:22.068
- [babbling]
- [胡言乱语]

08:22.137 --> 08:23.241
- Patrick, I'm going in.
- 帕特里克，我要进去了。

08:23.310 --> 08:24.241
Cover me.
掩护我。

08:24.310 --> 08:25.655
[grunts]
[咕哝]

08:25.724 --> 08:27.172
- I gotcha, buddy!
- 我明白了，伙计！

08:27.241 --> 08:28.758
- Huh?
Whoa!
- 啊？
哇！

08:28.827 --> 08:30.379
[grunts]
[咕哝]

08:30.448 --> 08:32.482
What?
Hey, where'd DoodleBob go?
什么？
嘿，嘟嘟鲍勃去哪儿了？

08:32.551 --> 08:34.586
- Over here.
- Yipe!
- 在这里。
- 伊佩！

08:34.655 --> 08:36.413
You let him go, Doodle.
你让他走吧，嘟嘟。

08:36.482 --> 08:38.413
- [babbles]
- [胡言乱语]

08:38.482 --> 08:40.241
- [exclaims]
- [惊呼]

08:40.310 --> 08:41.965
- [babbles]
- [胡言乱语]

08:42.034 --> 08:43.241
- [exclaims]
- [惊呼]

08:43.310 --> 08:44.241
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

08:44.310 --> 08:45.241
- [yells]
- [大喊]

08:45.310 --> 08:47.206
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

08:47.275 --> 08:48.379
[bell chimes]
[钟声]

08:48.448 --> 08:49.862
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

08:49.931 --> 08:52.517
- [babbling]
- [胡言乱语]

08:52.586 --> 08:54.517
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:54.586 --> 08:56.344
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

08:56.413 --> 08:57.344
Patrick!
帕特里克！

08:57.413 --> 08:59.172
- [babbling]
- [胡言乱语]

08:59.241 --> 09:02.241
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

09:02.310 --> 09:03.517
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:03.586 --> 09:05.241
- Don't worry, Patrick!
- 别担心，帕特里克！

09:05.310 --> 09:07.482
I'm coming for you!
我来找你了！

09:07.551 --> 09:09.551
- Good to know!
- 很高兴知道！

09:09.620 --> 09:11.793
- Surrender peacefully,
DoodleBob,
- 和平投降，
嘟嘟鲍勃，

09:11.862 --> 09:16.275
or face the wrath of...
或面对...的愤怒

09:16.344 --> 09:19.310
SpongeBob,
Knight of the Square Table.
海绵宝宝，
方桌骑士。

09:19.379 --> 09:20.344
[grunts]
[咕哝]

09:20.413 --> 09:22.206
Charge!
收费！

09:22.275 --> 09:23.931
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

09:24.000 --> 09:25.827
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

09:25.896 --> 09:26.827
Ha-ha!
哈哈！

09:26.896 --> 09:28.068
[thud]
[砰]

09:28.137 --> 09:29.862
- [laughing]
- [笑]

09:32.379 --> 09:36.241
- Release my friend
before I get really tough!
- 释放我的朋友
在我变得真正强硬之前！

09:36.310 --> 09:38.620
- [babbles]
- [胡言乱语]

09:38.689 --> 09:39.758
[screaming]
[尖叫]

09:39.827 --> 09:41.379
- I gotcha, I gotcha!
- 我明白了，我明白了！

09:41.448 --> 09:42.448
both: Oof!
两人：噢！

09:42.517 --> 09:44.275
- [groans, gasps]
- [呻吟，喘气]

09:44.344 --> 09:48.379
all: [babbling]
全体：[胡言乱语]

09:48.448 --> 09:50.448
[thumping]
[怦]

09:50.517 --> 09:53.896
[screaming]
[尖叫]

09:53.965 --> 09:55.655
- What are we gonna do?
- 我们要做什么？

09:55.724 --> 09:57.241
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

09:57.310 --> 09:58.413
- In here.
- 在这里。

09:58.482 --> 10:01.103
[babbling]
[胡说]

10:02.379 --> 10:03.655
Phew.
唷。

10:03.724 --> 10:05.586
- Nah-nah, you missed us!
- 不不，你想念我们了！

10:05.655 --> 10:08.655
Now you gotta kiss us!
现在你要吻我们！

10:08.724 --> 10:11.482
- [babbles]
- [胡言乱语]

10:11.551 --> 10:13.620
- Nah-nah...
- Patrick.
- 不不不...
- 帕特里克.

10:13.689 --> 10:15.000
- What?
[gasps]
- 什么？
[喘气]

10:15.068 --> 10:16.758
- [babbling]
- [胡言乱语]

10:16.827 --> 10:19.965
- Oh, we'll never
get back home.
- 哦，我们永远不会
回家吧。

10:20.034 --> 10:23.620
- We'll never see
our balloon Squeaky again.
- 我们永远不会看到
我们的气球又吱吱作响了。

10:23.689 --> 10:25.344
- Oh, Squeaky.
[gasps]
-哦，吱吱。
[喘气]

10:25.413 --> 10:26.931
Squeaky!
吱吱！

10:27.000 --> 10:28.206
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

10:28.275 --> 10:29.310
Grab on, buddy!
抓住吧，伙计！

10:29.379 --> 10:31.172
all: [babbling]
全体：[胡言乱语]

10:31.241 --> 10:33.310
- [babbles]
- Too slow, DoodleBob!
- [胡言乱语]
- 太慢了，DoodleBob！

10:33.379 --> 10:35.586
- [babbling]
- [胡言乱语]

10:35.655 --> 10:37.379
- Uh, SpongeBob.
- 呃，海绵宝宝。

10:37.448 --> 10:43.620
all: [babbling]
全体：[胡言乱语]

10:43.689 --> 10:45.517
- [panting]
Here, Patrick.
- [气喘吁吁]
在这里，帕特里克。

10:45.586 --> 10:47.655
- Oh, ooh, uh...
snip.
- 哦，哦，呃...
剪断。

10:47.724 --> 10:50.137
[screaming]
[尖叫]

10:50.206 --> 10:52.586
all: [babbling]
全体：[胡言乱语]

10:52.655 --> 10:55.275
- Well, that's the end
of DoodleBob.
- 嗯，就这样结束了
涂鸦鲍勃。

10:55.344 --> 10:57.275
- But we're still stuck here.
- 但我们仍然被困在这里。

10:57.344 --> 10:58.655
- Oh, yeah.
- 哦，是的。

10:58.724 --> 11:00.034
Too bad Sandy isn't here.
可惜桑迪不在。

11:00.103 --> 11:03.206
She'd find a way
to get us back home.
她会找到办法
让我们回家。

11:03.275 --> 11:04.586
Wait a minute, Patrick.
等一下，帕特里克。

11:04.655 --> 11:06.862
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

11:06.931 --> 11:09.000
Doodle us home, Sandy.
桑迪，在我们家涂鸦。

11:09.068 --> 11:12.275
- [babbles]
- [胡言乱语]

11:12.344 --> 11:14.413
Bleeble blobble blortex!
Bleeble blobble blortex！
Bleeble blobble blortex！
Bleeble blobble blotex！

11:14.482 --> 11:16.551
[whirring]
[呼呼]

11:16.620 --> 11:17.689
both: Yay!
两人：耶！

11:17.758 --> 11:19.068
Thanks, Sandy!
谢谢，桑迪！

11:19.137 --> 11:20.517
- Whoo!
- Whoo-hoo-hoo-hoo!
- 呼！
- 呼呼呼！

11:20.586 --> 11:23.241
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

11:23.310 --> 11:24.689
- Hmm, mm-hmm...
- 嗯，嗯嗯……

11:24.758 --> 11:25.689
[whirring]
[呼呼]

11:25.758 --> 11:27.137
What the--?
什么——？

11:27.206 --> 11:29.517
[whirring]
[呼呼]

11:29.586 --> 11:31.344
- Sandy, we're back.
- 桑迪，我们回来了。

11:31.413 --> 11:32.655
[crinkling]
[起皱]

11:32.724 --> 11:33.862
[inhaling]
[吸气]

11:33.931 --> 11:35.724
- I ain't fixed the vortex yet!
- 我还没修好漩涡！

11:35.793 --> 11:37.448
How in tarnation
did you get back?
如何在塔内
你回来了吗？

11:37.517 --> 11:39.965
- Sandy saved us.
- 桑迪救了我们。

11:40.034 --> 11:41.275
- What?
- 什么？

11:41.344 --> 11:42.482
Huh?
啊？

11:42.551 --> 11:44.413
- Give me back my nuts!
- 把我的坚果还给我！

11:44.482 --> 11:45.586
- [gulps]
- [吞咽]

11:45.655 --> 11:47.310
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

11:47.379 --> 11:49.586
- [laughs, babbles]
- [笑声，胡言乱语]

- [笑声，胡言乱语]